                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How much does Christmas + New Year drive for global gifting D2C?</h3>
                                        <p>30-45% of annual revenue for USA + UK + international gifting-focused brands. Peak global gifting season.</p>
                                        <h3>When should Christmas planning begin?</h3>
                                        <p>October at latest. Inventory + campaign design + creator + international operational preparation.</p>
                                        <h3>Should India brands do Christmas?</h3>
                                        <p>Metro + tier-1 focused: yes but Diwali + Indian wedding season larger for India-focused brands. Christmas better for international-expanding brands.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest Christmas D2C mistake?</h3>
                                        <p>Under-inventoried + late shipping + weak returns handling. All three destroy Christmas revenue + customer experience + reviews.</p>
